<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιωπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤψ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place commanding a wide view</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				272e
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράκτιος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.167
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ περιωπῆς</span> from <i>a
				place of vantage</i>, by <i>a bird's-eye view</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Symp.</u>
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Im.</u>
				1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ π. τοῦ Πηλίου</span> from
				<i>the summit</i> of P., <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Her.</u>
				19.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>circumspection</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὴν π. τινὸς
				ποιεῖσθαι</span> to show much <i>caution</i> in a thing,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>contemplation</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμης, τοῦ
				θείου</span>, Procl <i><span class="en">
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				pp.19,21
			</span></i> C. : pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς τοῦ νοῦ π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				54
			</span></i>.</div>
